{"id":"586b77ffc2cf4dd2","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-bddpathdnf.md","title":"Orthogonal path representation of a BDD","display":"thm-bddpathdnf — Orthogonal path representation of a BDD","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-bddpathdnf","aliases":["27-thm-bddpathdnf"],"display":"thm-bddpathdnf — Orthogonal path representation of a BDD","depends_on":["[[27-df-bdd]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§1.12.3; Theorem 1.35","source_printed_pages":"48,49","source_pdf_pages":"72,73","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-bddpathdnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-bddpathdnf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bddpathdnf — Orthogonal path representation of a BDD"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c4aaed843fab5b1c\" href=\"?note=c4aaed843fab5b1c\" title=\"27-df-bdd\">27-df-bdd</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.12.3; Theorem 1.35"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"48,49"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"72,73"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)\">\\(G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c4aaed843fab5b1c\" href=\"?note=c4aaed843fab5b1c\" title=\"27-df-bdd\">27-df-bdd</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_1\">\\(\\mathcal P_1\\)</span> 是下节构造的带边标签路径编码族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(v,b)\">\\(P=(v,b)\\)</span> 分解为顶点序列和离开边标签序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k(P)\">\\(k(P)\\)</span> 是下节构造的路径边数。空积等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)\\)</span> 亦见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c4aaed843fab5b1c\" href=\"?note=c4aaed843fab5b1c\" title=\"27-df-bdd\">27-df-bdd</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_1\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k=0}^{|V|-1}\\left\\{(v,b)\\in V^{\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}}\\times\\{0,1\\}^{\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t&lt;k\\}}\\;\\middle|\\;v_0=r\\land(v_k,1)\\in\\tau\\land\\forall t\\in\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:s&lt;k\\}\\;\\left((v_t,v_{t+1})\\in s_{b_t}\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_1\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k=0}^{|V|-1}\\left\\{(v,b)\\in V^{\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}}\\times\\{0,1\\}^{\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t&lt;k\\}}\\;\\middle|\\;v_0=r\\land(v_k,1)\\in\\tau\\land\\forall t\\in\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:s&lt;k\\}\\;\\left((v_t,v_{t+1})\\in s_{b_t}\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"k(P)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{dom}(b)|\\quad(P=(v,b)\\in\\mathcal P_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[k(P)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{dom}(b)|\\quad(P=(v,b)\\in\\mathcal P_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_P(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{t=0}^{k(P)-1}\\left(b_t a_{\\lambda(v_t)}+(1-b_t)(1-a_{\\lambda(v_t)})\\right)\\quad(P=(v,b)\\in\\mathcal P_1,\\ a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_P(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{t=0}^{k(P)-1}\\left(b_t a_{\\lambda(v_t)}+(1-b_t)(1-a_{\\lambda(v_t)})\\right)\\quad(P=(v,b)\\in\\mathcal P_1,\\ a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)(a)=\\sum_{P\\in\\mathcal P_1}C_P(a),\\qquad\\forall P,Q\\in\\mathcal P_1\\;(P\\ne Q\\Rightarrow\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;C_P(a)C_Q(a)=0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)(a)=\\sum_{P\\in\\mathcal P_1}C_P(a),\\qquad\\forall P,Q\\in\\mathcal P_1\\;(P\\ne Q\\Rightarrow\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;C_P(a)C_Q(a)=0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>路径以顶点列与边标签列成对编码；有限无环图的路径至多有 |V|−1 条边，零边路径用单一根顶点与空边标签列编码。每个输入只沿唯一的根到叶路径运行；当且仅当该路径终点为 1，恰有一个路径乘积为 1。含冲突测试的路径乘积恒零，可直接舍去，其余路径项构成正交 DNF。对决策树每叶只有一条路径，输出项数至多叶数，项长至多树深；一般共享节点的 BDD 可能有指数多路径。已核对原书构造和 Theorem 1.35 的计数论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-bdd","status":"resolved","id":"c4aaed843fab5b1c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bdd]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bdd","status":"resolved","id":"c4aaed843fab5b1c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)$，$\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)$，见 [[27-df-bdd]]。$a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$；$\\mathcal P_1$ 是下节构造的带边标签路径编码族，$P=(v,b)$ 分解为顶点序列和离开边标签序列；$k(P)$ 是下节构造的路径边数。空积等于 $1$。 $\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)$ 亦见 [[27-df-bdd]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bdd","status":"resolved","id":"c4aaed843fab5b1c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)$，$\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)$，见 [[27-df-bdd]]。$a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$；$\\mathcal P_1$ 是下节构造的带边标签路径编码族，$P=(v,b)$ 分解为顶点序列和离开边标签序列；$k(P)$ 是下节构造的路径边数。空积等于 $1$。 $\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)$ 亦见 [[27-df-bdd]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_1","display":false},{"tex":"P=(v,b)","display":false},{"tex":"k(P)","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_1\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k=0}^{|V|-1}\\left\\{(v,b)\\in V^{\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}}\\times\\{0,1\\}^{\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t<k\\}}\\;\\middle|\\;v_0=r\\land(v_k,1)\\in\\tau\\land\\forall t\\in\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:s<k\\}\\;\\left((v_t,v_{t+1})\\in s_{b_t}\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"k(P)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{dom}(b)|\\quad(P=(v,b)\\in\\mathcal P_1).","display":true},{"tex":"C_P(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{t=0}^{k(P)-1}\\left(b_t a_{\\lambda(v_t)}+(1-b_t)(1-a_{\\lambda(v_t)})\\right)\\quad(P=(v,b)\\in\\mathcal P_1,\\ a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)(a)=\\sum_{P\\in\\mathcal P_1}C_P(a),\\qquad\\forall P,Q\\in\\mathcal P_1\\;(P\\ne Q\\Rightarrow\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;C_P(a)C_Q(a)=0).","display":true}],"bytes":2457,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-bddpathdnf|thm-bddpathdnf — Orthogonal path representation of a BDD]]"}],"outgoing":["c4aaed843fab5b1c"]}